          "git_sha": "f4bfb62b33023ae77ce7110a8bd6020fe38c7fc6",
          "line_end": 14,
          "line_start": 14,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "almogdepaz/wolfpack",
          "url": "https://github.com/almogdepaz/wolfpack/blob/0c7ee60e7163435a849a3a7f9ce662f7dd2fe869/README.md#L14-L14"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_8f7daf0162d39cbdccf5a2146d69802bafc0a5a15269e39bee59a9ab5d7d29e0"
      ],
      "text": "Sessions run in a Rust PTY broker separate from the web server, so closing the browser or restarting only the web server does not end sessions; a broker restart or login-service reinstall can terminate them."
    },
