        "slc_ffa0e82d10a68aae9cc093be5fb918bac63b33f1d1bbd36438d06a5175f8587b"
      ],
      "text": "The tool grants browser users shell-level control over configured projects; session control follows the global API auth policy and has no inter-session authorization layer, so it should be kept on a trusted Tailnet with ACLs or JWT."
    },
